  << /ActualText (Intensive Career Transition\072 Completed an 1000\053 hour immersive program with a dedicated outcomes focus\054 mastering the end\055to\055end product lifecycle from discovery to delivery\056\nSharper Sense \050Client Consultancy\051\072 Led a high\055impact design sprint to define product strategy and core feature sets for a biotech company\054 delivering a full handoff of a high\055fidelity prototyped site and strategic content that facilitated successful seed funding and initial launch\056\nEpic Funds\050Client Consultancy\051\072 Led a comprehensive product discovery and redesign process for a private equity fund\056 Provided strategic consultation to determine optimal product\055market fit between a promotional site and a functional technology platform\054 resulting in increased brand clarity and consumer engagement\056\nStakeholder Management\072 Developed and presented high\055fidelity prototypes and research synthesis to local business partners\054 ensuring design solutions aligned with technical constraints and business goals\056)
